  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 48788832256
    m_Localized: Get a room at the inn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48805609472
    m_Localized: Like the mercenaries said, find lodging first. The inn is at the
      far right of the square.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22116481794048
    m_Localized: Hire mercenaries and take a quest at the guild
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22116494376960
    m_Localized: The innkeeper says mercenaries and work are found at the guild,
      at the far left of the square. Hire two mercenaries and take a quest from the
      board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22116494376961
    m_Localized: Pack rations and head to the gate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22116494376962
    m_Localized: Buy rations for the expedition from the innkeeper, then talk to
      the gate guard. Each person eats one ration a day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103287210901504
    m_Localized: Clear the Goblins in Region 1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103287215095808
    m_Localized: Defeat every goblin in Region 1. You can return at the gate even
      if you haven't finished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103287231873024
    m_Localized: Return to the Gate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103287231873025
    m_Localized: All the goblins are down. Return at the gate with F to finish the
      quest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
